<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Junaid — Gearbox Casing Optimization</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --brown-950:#241610;
    --brown-900:#2E1D14;
    --brown-800:#3A251A;
    --tan-500:#A9836A;
    --tan-400:#BE9C81;
    --tan-300:#D7BFA9;
    --cream:#FFFFFF;
    --ink-900:#2A2019;
    --ink-600:#5B4C40;
    --line:#E7DCD1;
    --radius:4px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}

  html,body{
    width:100%;
    background:var(--cream);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink-900);
    overflow-x:hidden;
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
  }

  ::selection{ background:var(--tan-400); color:#fff; }

  .page{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;
    max-width:1150px;
    margin:0 auto;
    min-height:100vh;
    background:var(--cream);
    box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  /* ---------- SIDEBAR ---------- */
  .sidebar{
    background:var(--brown-950);
    color:#EFE7DF;
    padding:48px 32px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .sidebar::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:-80px; right:-80px;
    width:220px; height:220px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--tan-500) 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity:0.15;
    animation: pulseGlow 4s infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes pulseGlow {
    0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.15; }
    100% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 0.25; }
  }

  .nav-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--brown-950);
    background: var(--tan-400);
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(169,131,106,0.3);
  }
  
  .nav-btn:hover {
    background: var(--cream);
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }

  .sidebar h3{
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#fff;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:14px;
    position:relative;
    padding-bottom:10px;
  }
  
  .sidebar h3::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0; bottom:0;
    height:2px; width:34px;
    background:var(--tan-500);
    transform-origin:left;
    animation:growLine .8s ease .3s both;
  }
  
  @keyframes growLine{ from{ transform:scaleX(0);} to{ transform:scaleX(1);} }

  .side-block{
    margin-bottom:34px;
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateX(-16px);
    animation:slideIn .6s ease forwards;
  }
  .side-block:nth-of-type(1){ animation-delay:.25s; }
  .side-block:nth-of-type(2){ animation-delay:.4s; }

  @keyframes slideIn{ to{ opacity:1; transform:translateX(0); } }

  .sidebar p{ font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.75; color:#D9CFC5; }

  /* ---------- MAIN ---------- */
  .main{ background:var(--cream); }

  .hero{
    background:linear-gradient(120deg, var(--tan-500), var(--tan-400));
    padding:52px 48px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 0 2px, transparent 2px 40px);
    animation:driftBg 12s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes driftBg{ from{ background-position:0 0; } to{ background-position:400px 0; } }

  .hero h1{
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:36px;
    font-weight:800;
    color:#fff;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    line-height: 1.2;
    opacity:0;
    animation:riseIn .7s ease .2s forwards;
  }
  .hero h2{
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:4px;
    color:#3A2A1E;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-top:12px;
    opacity:0;
    animation:riseIn .7s ease .4s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes riseIn{ from{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(18px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }

  section.block{ padding:40px 48px; }

  .section-title{
    font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brown-950);
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18px;
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  .section-title::after{
    content:"";
    flex:1;
    height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--tan-500), transparent);
    animation: stretchLine 1.5s ease-out forwards;
    transform-origin: left;
  }

  @keyframes stretchLine {
    0% { transform: scaleX(0); }
    100% { transform: scaleX(1); }
  }

  /* reveal-on-scroll */
  .reveal{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(30px); transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1); }
  .reveal.in{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

  /* Content Cards */
  .content-card {
    background: #FBF8F5;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--tan-500);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
  }

  .content-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.01);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(46,29,20,0.08);
    border-left-color: var(--brown-950);
  }

  .content-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent);
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: 0.6s;
  }
  
  .content-card:hover::before {
    transform: translateX(100%);
  }

  .content-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--brown-950);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .content-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--ink-600);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .content-card ul {
    margin: 10px 0 16px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-600);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  
  .content-card ul li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    padding-left: 5px;
  }

  /* Data Table */
  .data-table-wrapper {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 20px 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    transform: scale(0.95);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .data-table-wrapper.in {
    transform: scale(1);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .styled-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }

  .styled-table th {
    background: var(--brown-950);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .styled-table td {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-900);
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }

  .styled-table tbody tr {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .styled-table tbody tr:hover {
    background: #FBF8F5;
    transform: scale(1.01);
  }

  .styled-table tbody tr:hover td {
    color: var(--tan-500);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Image Integration */
  .paper-image {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    display: block;
    margin: 30px auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(46,29,20,0.15);
    transition: all 0.5s ease;
    filter: sepia(0.2) contrast(1.1);
  }

  .paper-image:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(1deg) scale(1.03);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(46,29,20,0.25);
    filter: sepia(0) contrast(1);
  }
  
  .cite {
    font-size: 11px;
    background: var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-600);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    vertical-align: super;
    font-family: monospace;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* Staggered lists */
  .stagger-list li {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-20px);
  }
  
  .stagger-list.in li {
    animation: slideRightFade 0.5s forwards;
  }
  
  .stagger-list.in li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .stagger-list.in li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .stagger-list.in li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
  .stagger-list.in li:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  .stagger-list.in li:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }

  @keyframes slideRightFade {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
  }

  footer{
    text-align:center; padding:30px; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-600);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    background: #FBF8F5;
  }

  @media (max-width:760px){
    .page{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .hero h1{ font-size:28px; letter-spacing:1px; }
    section.block, .hero{ padding-left:26px; padding-right:26px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">

  <!-- ================= SIDEBAR ================= -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <a href="#" class="nav-btn">← Back to Profile</a>

    <div class="side-block">
      <h3>Project Focus</h3>
      <p>A detailed breakdown of finite-element-based optimization for transmission systems, extracted from International Research Journal of Engineering and Technology (IRJET) <span class="cite"></span>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="side-block">
      <h3>Source Details</h3>
      <p><strong>Journal:</strong> IRJET<br>
      <strong>Volume:</strong> 03 Issue: 12<br>
      <strong>Date:</strong> Dec -2016<br>
      <strong>Page:</strong> 687 <span class="cite"></span></p>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- ================= MAIN ================= -->
  <main class="main">

    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Research Methodology</h1>
      <h2>Gearbox Casing Optimization</h2>
    </div>

    <section class="block reveal">
      <div class="section-title">III. Methodology</div>
      <div class="content-card">
        <p>The problem under consideration will be modeled through four approaches <span class="cite"></span> (Note: source text states "four approaches" but lists five):</p>
        <ul class="stagger-list reveal">
          <li><strong>A.</strong> CAD Modeling <span class="cite"></span></li>
          <li><strong>B.</strong> Finite Element Meshing <span class="cite"></span></li>
          <li><strong>C.</strong> Boundary Conditions <span class="cite"></span></li>
          <li><strong>D.</strong> Finite Element Analysis <span class="cite"></span></li>
          <li><strong>E.</strong> Optimization <span class="cite"></span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block reveal">
      <div class="section-title">A. CAD Modeling</div>
      <div class="content-card">
        <h4>⚙️ Base & Optimized Design Parameters</h4>
        <p>The important parametric quantity while designing gear box casing is ribbing which is to attain required strength <span class="cite"></span>. The CAD model is imported into IGES file format to the FEM design software Altair Hypermesh 11.0 <span class="cite"></span>.</p>
        
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Existing CAD Model (Fig.1):</strong> The CAD Model of gearbox casing specification is Length-1435mm Width-520mm Height- 800mm <span class="cite"></span>.</li>
          <li><strong>Optimized CAD Model (Fig.2):</strong> The CAD Model of gearbox casing specification is Length-1465mm, Width-540mm, Height- 870mm and wall thickness reduced from 16mm to 14mm <span class="cite"></span>.</li>
        </ul>

        <img src="image_4511b9.png" alt="IRJET Research Paper Page 687" class="paper-image reveal" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block reveal">
      <div class="section-title">Table 1. Gearbox Specification</div>
      <div class="data-table-wrapper reveal">
        <table class="styled-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Parameter</th>
              <th>Value</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Input Power</td>
              <td>84kW <span class="cite"></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Input Speed</td>
              <td>1000 rpm <span class="cite"></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Output speed</td>
              <td>16 rpm <span class="cite"></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Unit size</td>
              <td>15 <span class="cite"></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Mechanical Rating Power</td>
              <td>151kW <span class="cite"></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Ratio</td>
              <td>63:1 <span class="cite"></span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Overhung load</td>
              <td>150kN <span class="cite"></span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block reveal">
      <div class="section-title">B. FEM Model</div>
      <div class="content-card">
        <h4>🖥️ Meshing & Geometry Cleanup</h4>
        <p>The cad model in IGES format is imported in HyperMesh for the preparation of FE model <span class="cite"></span>. Then geometry cleanup was done by using options like 'geom. Cleanup' and 'defeature' to modify the geometry data and prepapre it for meshing operation <span class="cite"></span>.</p>
        
        <ul>
          <li>Mesh model is prepared by using Hypermesh 11.0 <span class="cite"></span>.</li>
          <li>2D Quad or tria meshing is carried out on all the outer and inner surfaces of the geometry, quads splits to trias and then converted to tetras <span class="cite"></span>.</li>
          <li>A 4-node Linear Tetra 3D solid elements are used to model of Gearbox and End covers <span class="cite"></span>.</li>
          <li>The element size selected for Casing and End covers mesh is 10mm <span class="cite"></span>.</li>
          <li>Gearbox model is meshed with about 207700 nodes 792400 elements <span class="cite"></span>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>© Junaid — Enhanced Research Portfolio Page. Document data extracted from IRJET <span class="cite"></span>.</footer>
  </main>

</div>

<script>
  // Advanced Intersection Observer for multiple animation types
  const revealEls = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
  const listEls = document.querySelectorAll('.stagger-list');
  const tableEls = document.querySelectorAll('.data-table-wrapper');

  const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if(entry.isIntersecting){
        entry.target.classList.add('in');
        // Optional: unobserve after animating to keep it static, 
        // or leave it observing to re-trigger (though standard practice is to unobserve)
        io.unobserve(entry.target); 
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: "0px 0px -50px 0px" });

  revealEls.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
  listEls.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
  tableEls.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
</script>

